  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large tagliere over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the rinsed rice and cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the water, salt, and black pepper, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes.",
    "Turn off the heat and let it steam, covered, for 5 minutes.",
    "Fluff the rice with a fork and stir in the chopped cilantro.",
    "Serve hot.",
    "Let it cool completely before refrigerating or freezing."
